    {
      "id": "deckbench",
      "name": "DECKBench",
      "scope": {
        "en": "294 project tasks × 5 edits · Task 2",
        "zh": "项目实验 294 个任务 × 5 轮编辑 · Task 2"
      },
      "note": {
        "en": "ΔDTW and ΔTransSim are mean baseline-relative changes from turn 0 to turn 5, not raw differences. Simulator and instruction granularity differ across blocks. Project between-model confidence intervals include zero; edits import artifacts into fresh workspaces.",
        "zh": "ΔDTW 与 ΔTransSim 是第 0 轮到第 5 轮相对初稿的平均变化，不是原始分数差。各组的用户模拟器、指令粒度不同。项目模型间差异的置信区间包含零；每轮将产物导入新工作区。"
      },
      "groups": [
